  "content": "\n\n<h1>SchematicPreview</h1>\n<p>為 Litematica Fabric 模組增添多項實用功能的插件。</p>\n<h2>模組功能：</h2>\n<h3>結構圖預覽</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DimasKama/SchematicPreview/refs/heads/master/images/previews.png\" alt=\"previews\"></p>\n<h3>資料夾圖示</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DimasKama/SchematicPreview/refs/heads/master/images/directories_icons.png\" alt=\"directories_icons\"></p>\n<h3>材料列表中的替換按鈕</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DimasKama/SchematicPreview/refs/heads/master/images/replace_button.png\" alt=\"replace_button\"></p>",
